ip Layer changed the object itself, even though its window is only the first 15 percent of the run.", "url": "sampling_lab/flow-slg.jpg", "sha256": "da456ea896b63648", "baseline": false, "brightness": 99.9, "contrast": 79.2, "edge": 10.83, "diff_to_base": 22.68, "identical_to": []}, {"id": "flow-cfgzerostar", "set": "flow", "method": "cfgzerostar", "label": "cfgzerostar", "model": "sd35", "sampler": "euler", "scheduler": "simple", "cfg": 4.5, "patches": [["CFGZeroStar", {}]], "guider": null, "status": "rendered", "seconds": 3.6, "note": "", "seen": "", "url": "sampling_lab/flow-cfgzerostar.jpg", "sha256": "4af28c7edad350e3", "baseline": false, "brightness": 92.7, "contrast": 77.4, "edge": 10.52, "diff_to_base": 7.58, "identical_to": []}], "seen": [{"text": "The ddim sampler name gives the same pixels as euler (same seed, same graph). Core maps the name to Euler; only the inpaint noise option differs.", "id": "", "where": "measured here, see Renders", "source": "renders"}, {"text": "CFGNorm at strength 1 with CFG 14 washed an SDXL render to pale grey on this seed, while Rescale and APG at the same CFG stayed usable.", "id": "", "where": "measured here, see Renders", "source": "renders"}, {"text": "The linear_quadratic schedule with dpmpp_2m smeared an SDXL render at 20 steps, with rainbow speckle. On this model its last non-zero sigma at 20 steps is 2.67, against 0.03 for karras, so the last step jumps a long way to zero.", "id": "", "where": "measured here, see Renders", "source": "renders"}, {"text": "ddim_uniform starts lower than the rest: sigma 11.03 at 20 steps on SD and SDXL, where the others start at 14.61. It rendered brighter, with a different layout.", "id": "", "where": "measured here, see Renders", "source": "renders"}, {"text": "Karras at 20 steps broke SD 3.5 Medium with Euler (brown and unfinished), while simple, beta and kl_optimal held together on the same seed.", "id": "", "where": "measured here, see Renders", "source": "renders"}], "bases": {"sampler": "sampler-euler", "scheduler": "scheduler-normal", "guidance": "guidance-cfg-7", "flow": "flow-euler-simple"}, "pack_lab": {"attempted": 6, "rendered": 0, "why": "The Pack Lab sandbox failed the control render too (VAEDecode: maximum recursion depth exceeded), so no non-core method is proven by render here."}}